", "id": "3641550656146307", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_3641550659479640_8867883677995369303_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u37iA47J8hkQ7kNvwGHkGZn&_nc_oc=AdpToERFxKOUv9Utb1WTW9MrUVysKT74Nh3nJVp3rReVNGWuJm2882H5qAy9Glj2hUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTtC08Q6gx_gBuKgeArWTKuaSZXNc0pR0bU2bWRc2TG7A&oe=6AF3229E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "606329465659295", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_606329468992628_8346371957676797649_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1lI2e2KBqssQ7kNvwEytVJM&_nc_oc=AdpQSsHsoUx8Kn2PXcbsq5HnBCZ6s92yo_47FZ5j0d-PtVXVukqIMbKyww-uETRuf_E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRIoZnuxXKJgdLivvo5jYTRiEXLDaPXtbo-wvyQ60UTDw&oe=6AF340D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot1.png", "id": "1460316745170605", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_1460316748503938_3292300042834351776_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wmj3ufK646YQ7kNvwHNrI6p&_nc_oc=Adp2GIvZ1PtkiSkkwg5YGoIG-PpSqVPF98397N-nsN-CEogdNfF4BO4qtTnbDRmchz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyElP0PtsWeowQ-y0S4nWuc5IjXhdWVEKzJ5wfieGeaw&oe=6AF34496"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "1455540008824715", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618440_1455540012158048_1649248167125430766_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pk28scxnLPQQ7kNvwEvo9CS&_nc_oc=AdrKsq7y3BQN64gyAtAc0G9Z8I6MeUJpv1OXuI-8KgtCNBUuMS83-D6FldM43vz780k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRek0R4Uh4DuS3vjKY2hHMRhVm0eZu-8V20KqgSzb9xkA&oe=6AF35993"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "4038756736363000", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_4038756739696333_2834424856108332602_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8u5dbhS2q9UQ7kNvwHke0hq&_nc_oc=AdqgXIVprh_L-EDGCqWr1mee9JArYjTDy18ug1JHX0YPJkfXurGkaWF_ihhpexELva4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRS6R1mOqrusgASeWXLI8Fv0hkI_mMgpbBj--eXgRe4Ew&oe=6AF33B7B"}, "display_name": "The Endless Drive", "keywords": ["Survival", "Car", "Action", "Driving", "Zombie"], "long_description": "**SURVIVE THE APOCALYPSE ON FOUR WHEELS!\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8**\n\nGrab the wheel and drive to survive in the ultimate post-apocalyptic road trip. This is your story. Your journey. Your rules of survival.\n## **\ud83e\udd1d TEAM UP OR GO SOLO**\n\n Survive with friends in up to 4-player co-op, or brave the desolate roads alone. When you're solo, all the loot is yours, but so are all the dangers. The choice is yours.\n## **\ud83d\udd27 BUILD YOUR ROLLING FORTRESS**\n\n Your car is more than a vehicle\u2014it's your lifeline. Scavenge for parts, bolt on armor, mount powerful weapons, and turn your ride into a zombie-shredding machine.\n## **\u2694\ufe0f FIGHT THE DEAD AND THE LIVING**\n\n The undead are predictable, but the living are far more dangerous. Battle relentless zombie hordes and outsmart cunning human gangs who want your car, your supplies, and your life.\n## **\ud83d\udca5 CREATE YOUR OWN MAYHEM**\n\n This world is your chaotic playground. Use physics to your advantage\u2014send zombies flying with a reinforced bumper, or create explosive traps for unsuspecting gangs. If you can see it, you can probably break it.\n## **\ud83c\udf54 SURVIVE BEYOND THE BASICS**\n\n This isn't just about fighting. Scavenge for food and water, and yes, even find a safe place to answer nature's call. Neglect your needs, and become just another corpse on the road.\n", "short_description": "Grab the wheel, trust your friends, and survive the apocalypse together. Your ultimate road trip through a world of zombies and gangs begins now! "}]}, "developer_name": "Storay Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com